t equal gate types convert it to the standard alternating QAOA convention. The tree-to-SK step is still a separate theorem.","citation_ids":["circuit-r2-26-cite-ordinary-word-primary"],"evidence_ids":[],"id":"circuit.ordinary_word_primary","kind":"goal","label":"Primary-route finite ordinary near-optimal word","locator":"06-assembly.tex:1–34; proof of thm:main","source_id":"circuit-r2-26-source-assembly","statement":"For every ε>0, a finite ordinary cost/mixer word W, with deterministic real angles independent of D,n,J, has rooted energy greater than P_*−ε. Choose the classical input with error ε/4 and η_H=(ε/8)²; choose synthesis η=ε/8, so its two losses sum to less than ε/2; then remove the seed with error less than ε/4.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/circuit.ordinary_word_primary","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/circuit.high_girth_maxcut","id":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/edges/%5B%22circuit.high_girth_maxcut%22%2C%22circuit.ordinary_word_primary%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/edges/%5B%22circuit.high_girth_maxcut%22%2C%22circuit.ordinary_word_primary%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/circuit.ordinary_word_primary"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/circuit.ordinary_word_primary","id":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/edges/%5B%22circuit.ordinary_word_primary%22%2C%22circuit.classical_primary%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decd